  "gr-c1": {
    "file": "gr-c1.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "First conditional sentences describe things which are possible and likely to happen in the present or the future.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "a0e686bf9ad40201"
  },
  "gr-c2": {
    "file": "gr-c2.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "If you use less paper, you will save a lot of trees.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "006f545145cdf838"
  },
  "com-01": {
    "file": "com-01.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "You are giving the goldfish too much food. Don't do that.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "62d6751eef9d4347"
  },
  "com-01b": {
    "file": "com-01b.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Don't do that.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "d850ef712392f600"
  },
  "com-02": {
    "file": "com-02.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Why?",
    "voice": "en-GB-ThomasNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "e0b113adb6e2b34d"
  },
  "com-03": {
    "file": "com-03.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "If you give them too much food, they will die.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "f3c044439df6b057"
  },
  "com-04": {
    "file": "com-04.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "I see. Thank you.",
    "voice": "en-GB-ThomasNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "96ab0f231ea87fc6"
  },
  "com-05": {
    "file": "com-05.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "What's your answer to Question one?",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "677bc8ba8f948b51"
  },
  "com-06": {
    "file": "com-06.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "It's A. What's your answer?",
    "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "b061486ff732ca40"
  },
  "read-01": {
    "file": "read-01.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Can you share with us some tips to make your school greener?",
    "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "a274ffacb0b35ba6"
  },
  "read-02": {
    "file": "read-02.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Sure. Firstly, we put recycling bins in every classroom.",
    "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "d484daf1ed54ca23"
  },
  "read-03": {
    "file": "read-03.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "What about old books and uniforms?",
    "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "d0ab27c394f3417b"
  },
  "read-04": {
    "file": "read-04.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "We exchange them with our friends or give them to charity. We don't throw them away.",
    "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "167cfc943484c6fc"
  },
  "read-05": {
    "file": "read-05.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Anything else?",
    "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "2040d00e64879973"
  },
  "read-06": {
    "file": "read-06.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "We borrow books from the school library instead of buying new ones.",
    "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "7ca206a70c4299cf"
  },
  "read-07": {
    "file": "read-07.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Great! You can save much paper.",
    "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "d0b1a201eb2aa3a7"
  },
  "read-08": {
    "file": "read-08.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "And there's another tip. We bring reusable water bottles to school.",
    "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "1300742f2477ee57"
  },
  "read-09": {
    "file": "read-09.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "I see lots of trees in your school. Is planting trees a good tip?",
    "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "5c3c93b3ae4cd5bb"
  },
  "read-10": {
    "file": "read-10.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Yeah. It makes our school greener.",
    "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "210ea7adebced961"
  },
  "read-11": {
    "file": "read-11.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Thanks for sharing. Do you want to add anything?",
    "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "bda3cb7af7768a3e"
  },
  "read-12": {
    "file": "read-12.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Finally, we usually find creative ways to reuse old items before throwing them away.",
    "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "bc1799f23212df1e"
  },
  "pst-01": {
    "file": "pst-01.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Are you creative?",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "8e685d46c5f8ddfd"
  },
  "pst-02": {
    "file": "pst-02.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Do you want our school to be a green place?",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "99dd76bd9c22d896"
  },
  "pst-03": {
    "file": "pst-03.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "What will you do if you become our president?",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "86d95deb5ece83a6"
  },
  "pst-04": {
    "file": "pst-04.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Raise your voice and become our president!",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "de114cf5e47ee6fe"
  },
  "w-00a": {
    "file": "w-00a.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Giving explanations and / or examples is an important writing skill.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "0004399bdf1fb3a3"
  },
  "w-00b": {
    "file": "w-00b.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "You should give explanations and / or examples to support your ideas.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "8cdcad4cf14d1270"
  },
  "w-01": {
    "file": "w-01.mp3",
